  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "review-a0081df14803-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "BER-R-A1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 1,
      "summary": "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-canary-work.ts:584、1740：Pi 的 enrichAssuranceResult 无条件再次调用 projectAssuranceState，未遵守 coordinator 返回的 recovery_error。因此初始 authority projection 存在 semantic conflict 时，注册 Tool 仍会读取两次，违反一次读取后停止的契约。最小修复是在 recovery_error 存在时跳过 Host 的 projection、tracker 等后续观察，并保留原始错误及合法路径 reconciliation action；补充注册 Tool 层的读取次数回归测试。",
      "anchor": "sha256:73e036d64c840f779920515d6518f734063cc00f14e5c427e4388f332ce22a56",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "不变量类别：失败或语义无效的初始 authority observation 不得由后续 decoration 重新读取。调用 Pi 注册 Tool 的 advance_assurance，初始 projection 返回 backend claim belongs to another-task 的 semantic conflict：advanceOnce 返回 blocked 和 recovery_error，withRecovery 正确跳过读取，但 Tool 随后调用 enrichAssuranceResult，1740 行再次读取同一 authority projection。当前修复仅覆盖 coordinator.withRecovery，未覆盖外层 Host decoration，所以它不是对已有触发点的独立新缺陷，而是同一读取预算不变量的修复范围缺口。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-canary-work.ts:registered imm_kernel_canary.execute(advance_assurance)",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinator.advance",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinator.advanceOnce",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinator.withRecovery",
          "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-canary-work.ts:enrichAssuranceResult",
          "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-canary-work.ts:projectAssuranceState"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "BER-R-A1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    },
    {
      "id": "review-2097cc713579-1-review-1",
      "kind": "blocking",
      "status": "resolved",
      "acceptance_id": "BER-R-A1",
      "source": "review",
      "review_round": 2,
      "summary": "初始 authority observation 失败即停止这一 invariant 尚未覆盖 review_ready 入口：coordinator.ts:796-802 的 Review reservation 校验读取失败后返回不带 recovery_error 的 blocked，导致 :780-782 的 recovery decoration 再次读取，EACCES 因而至少读取两次。最小修复是在该失败返回中携带 recovery_error，并增加已有 Review reservation 下的读取次数回归测试；同步更新发布 bundle。",
      "anchor": "sha256:891b4ce4b269e5b04b0236d1a82afb403e1fee948fec1b86d2c842bcb61a3bba",
      "evidence": {
        "trigger": "QA 已成功提交且 coordinator 保有 Review reservation；再次调用 advance_assurance 时，reservation 校验的首次 projectTask 抛出带 code=EACCES 的 Error。advanceOnce 在主 preparation 分支之前返回 blocked，随后 advance 调用 withRecovery，再次调用 projectTask。Invariant class 是所有 advance 入口状态下失败初始 authority observation 的终止性；现有修复仅在后续主 preparation 分支设置 recovery_error，无法覆盖更早的 Review reservation 校验分支，因此这是该修复覆盖范围的缺口，而非新的单一触发缺陷。",
        "caller_chain": [
          "plugins/immune-brain/.pi-extension/imm-canary-work.ts:imm_kernel_canary.execute(advance_assurance)",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinator.advance",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinator.advanceOnce(review_ready reservation validation)",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinator.withRecovery",
          "plugins/immune-brain/runtime/assurance/coordinator.ts:AssuranceCoordinatorPorts.projectTask"
        ],
        "violated": {
          "kind": "acceptance",
          "ref": "BER-R-A1"
        }
      },
      "counterevidence": null
    }
